    "open library is a web server at \"https://openlibrary.org\":",
    "\t- its id is its \"key\"",
    "\t- its rows are its \"docs\"",
    "\t- check it every 30 seconds",
    "\t- it writes names like \"author_key\"",
    "\t- it searches titles with \"q\"",
    "\t- books are searched at \"/search.json\"",
    "\t- authors are found at \"/authors/{name}.json\"",
    "\t- editions are found at \"/books/{name}.json\"",
    "\t- a book's \"cover i\" is a picture at \"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/{id}-M.jpg\"",
    "",
    "a \"book\" is a thing:",
    "\t- it lives in open library",
    "\t- its \"authors\" is a list of authors, stored as \"author_key\"",
    "\t- its \"author name\" is a list of text",
    "\t- its \"cover edition\" is an edition, stored as \"cover_edition_key\"",
